    {
      "heading": "A foothold in gold",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-28-0941-arc-2-ac-enters-gold-lashen-out"
      ],
      "text": "ảc closes thirteenth at 71.53, up five places and 2.36 points since the previous close. That puts the entry above the provisional gold line of 69.72. The morning wire had already recorded its arrival in the gold places and Lashen Learning’s fall outside them; the closing result gives that advance a place in the day’s wider race."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Tufa’s pursuers hold their scores",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-yi-chia-chen-identity-0"
      ],
      "text": "Tufa Labs remains first at 88.06, with Yi-Chia Chen @ Fields Model second at 84.72 and Domdolus Tolus third at 82.08. nvbanana is fourth at 81.39 and rabbithole fifth at 80.83. All five keep their previous closing scores. Ravi Teja Chilakala occupies sixth at 76.94, just above Majkel1337 at 76.81; the saved baseline does not establish a daily gain for Chilakala."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The gains that moved the field",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-28-1241-arc-2-kaz-rises-to-fifty-first",
        "wire-2026-10-28-1541-arc-2-hieu-vy-climbs-to-forty-sixth",
        "wire-2026-10-28-1241-arc-2-yasser-othman-climbs-to-seventy-second"
      ],
      "text": "Kaz gains 11.53 to reach 51.67 and 52nd, up 21 places since the previous close. KhaoticDeotterministicSethesis adds 10.27 to reach 60.69 and 34th. Hiểu Vy rises thirteen places to 47th at 53.33 after a 9.16-point gain; Yasser Othman climbs 117 places to 73rd at 41.11. The wire followed Kaz, Hiểu Vy and Othman earlier in the day; these are their closing positions."
    },
    {
      "heading": "ARC Mutants advance; megsub’s closing comparison narrows",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-28-1541-arc-2-megsub-climbs-to-thirty-seventh"
      ],
      "text": "ARC Mutants adds 4.58 to reach 46.39 and 60th, six places higher than the previous close. megsub finishes 38th at 57.92, a net closing gain of 1.67 and one place. The wire’s earlier 16.67-point rise used a different rolling window, so it is not the evening’s daily gain. Arshjot Khehra holds 52.50 and finishes 50th. The requested follow-up on Khehra and Thanh Hau Nguyen’s methods remains open: the saved material does not establish their competition recipes."
    },
